```text
index.ts                         → Hono entrypoint serving API, SSE, and static web assets
src/db.ts                        → SQLite bootstrap, schema, seed data, and shared simulation primitives
src/simulator.ts                 → Market tick generation, price history mutation, kline aggregation helpers
src/risk.ts                      → Trading validation, limit-range checks, and shared order-risk helpers
src/auth.ts                      → Authentication and session APIs
src/market.ts                    → Market snapshot, watchlist, SSE, and market news APIs
src/news.ts                      → In-memory news generation and news listing APIs
src/trading.ts                   → Buy/sell/cancel/order list APIs and account mutation
src/portfolio.ts                 → Portfolio summary, exposure, and holdings APIs
src/history.ts                   → Trade history, daily snapshots, and trading highlights APIs
web/                             → Vite React application root
web/src/main.tsx                 → Frontend bootstrap and router mount
web/src/App.tsx                  → App shell, routing, and page composition
web/src/api.ts                   → API client, SSE client, and frontend formatting helpers
web/src/styles/theme.css         → Apple-style design tokens and global theme primitives
web/src/components/shared/       → Shared UI primitives used across pages
web/src/components/market/       → Market-home specific components
web/src/components/trading/      → Stock-detail and order-panel components
web/src/components/portfolio/    → Portfolio and history page components
web/src/pages/                  → Route-level page components for home and stock detail
web/src/pages/portfolio/         → Portfolio route page implementation
web/src/pages/history/           → History route page implementation
tests/api.test.ts                → API regression and delivery validation suite
